{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Summoner\u2019s Cookbook</strong>\u00a0</i>is an incremental idle game about summoning creatures and giving them tasks. Discover creature recipes and fill out your Cookbook!<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put your creatures to work!</strong><br>Let them farm, forage and refine ingredients used to summon more creatures! Have them summon for you, giving you time to discover new recipes or relax and do other things. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/a2f71e40cfe03497577879c686780dfe.poster.avif?t=1764768632\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/a2f71e40cfe03497577879c686780dfe.webm?t=1764768632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/a2f71e40cfe03497577879c686780dfe.mp4?t=1764768632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Summon creatures!</strong> <br>Decipher written scrolls and use your summoning circle to craft creatures to unlock more recipes for your cookbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/156ffa3ef9d8a201628a60acaf422460.poster.avif?t=1764768632\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/156ffa3ef9d8a201628a60acaf422460.webm?t=1764768632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/156ffa3ef9d8a201628a60acaf422460.mp4?t=1764768632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Take on requests for rewards!</strong>\u00a0<br>Deliver creatures to customers and reinvest your earnings to upgrade, build and expand. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563820?t=1764768632","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563820?t=1764768632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/ae15fcea0c276164f8f73d3635d7af34569553e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764768632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/ae15fcea0c276164f8f73d3635d7af34569553e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764768632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Summoner\u2019s Cookbook</strong>\u00a0</i>is an incremental idle game about summoning creatures and giving them tasks. Discover creature recipes and fill out your Cookbook!<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put your creatures to work!</strong><br>Let them farm, forage and refine ingredients used to summon more creatures! Have them summon for you, giving you time to discover new recipes or relax and do other things. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/a2f71e40cfe03497577879c686780dfe.poster.avif?t=1764768632\" width=1170 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/a2f71e40cfe03497577879c686780dfe.webm?t=1764768632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563820/extras/a2f71e40cfe03497577879c686780dfe.mp4?t=1764768632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Summon creatures!</strong> <br>D